    "description": "The Parking Reservations History API provides access to a comprehensive list of historical parking reservations made by users. This endpoint allows consumers, such as application developers and fleet management systems, to efficiently retrieve reservation data for reporting or auditing purposes. Users can filter and search through past reservations to analyze parking usage patterns, ensuring better management of parking resources. This functionality is essential for applications focused on enhancing user experience and optimizing parking space utilization.",
